\item[\ \ consequences in the grammar:]
For analysis purposes a transformation is required that resets the 
feature negpos throughout the tree. This transformation has not yet been 
written. It cannot be written as a normal M-rule (unlimited depth!). It must
apply after the Utterance Rule
